    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that potentially converts the value handed to\n<a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor.setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> to the type of the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> using a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> 可能会将传递给 <a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor.setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> 的值转换为 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 的类型，转换过程使用一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that will use an entity's\n<a href=\"../../annotation/PersistenceCreator.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>PersistenceCreator</code></a> to create a new instance of it to apply a new value\nfor a given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>，它将使用实体上的<a href=\"../../annotation/PersistenceCreator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>PersistenceCreator</code></a>来创建该实体的新实例，以便为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>应用新值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a> for the given delegate <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的委托 <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> for a given <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and <code>bean</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个针对给定<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>和<code>bean</code>的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"../model/InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a> using the given delegate <code>accessorFunction</code> and\n<a href=\"../model/EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的委托 `accessorFunction` 和 `<a href=\"../model/EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>` 创建一个 `<a href=\"../model/InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Extension of <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that is also able to obtain and set values for\n<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "扩展 <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>，使其能够获取和设置 <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a> 的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> for the current property's owning value.",
      "translation": "返回当前属性所属值的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> to access property values of the given bean.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>，用于访问给定 Bean 的属性值。",
      "count": 1
    },
